  m_text: "Well, whats left of it... \n\nThe walls have just been secured, but food
    reserves have run dry. \n\nThe campfire in the centre of camp is awaiting tonights
    meal and it is up to you to find the food required.\n\nWhen you are ready, head
    for the exit (  ) and venture out for your first hunt."
